      ":question/problem": "Find $k$ given that the vectors $a=\u27e87,8,8\u27e9$, $b=\u27e8-8,k,8\u27e9$, and $c=\u27e8-4,5,2\u27e9$ are coplanar.\n\n$k=${{field-1}}",
