      ":question/problem": "Find $k$ given that the vectors $a=\u27e86,-4,-4\u27e9$, $b=\u27e8-5,-7,-7\u27e9$, and $c=\u27e8-4,k,3\u27e9$ are coplanar.\n\n$k=${{field-1}}",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
