      ":question/problem": "Find $k$ given that the vectors $a=\u27e84,3,-8\u27e9$, $b=\u27e8-5,k,5\u27e9$, and $c=\u27e85,5,-5\u27e9$ are coplanar.\n\n$k=${{field-1}}",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
